		(property "Description" "PROPOSED 1:4 LVCMOS fan-out. TI LMK1C1104PWR (SNAS791D): output-output skew 25ps typ / 50ps max at 3.3V, additive jitter 8fs typ, ODC 45-55% with 50% input, ROUT 50 ohm. Run at 3.3V: Fig 10-3 shows no measurable close-in degradation at 3.3V, Fig 10-5 shows a 1.8V close-in hump."
